   "titulo": "One past for two of the Spanish",
   "texto": [
    "The **pretérito perfeito** is used for «I ate.» and also for «I've eaten.». In Portuguese, I have already eaten no time for that: **Já comi** =. **Ontem comi peixe** = yesterday I ate fish."
   ]
