  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "How it forms",
   "texto": [
    "It is removed -ar, -er or -go and the terminations are added. They are very similar to the Spanish ones.",
    "See «We» in the -ar verbs: in Portugal it has an accent, **falámos**, to distinguish it from the present «falamos»."
   ]
